1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,009
The consequences arrived as a notification on a very ordinary day.

2
00:00:04,009 --> 00:00:13,182
The officer from the council submitted a conduct report, and the candidate who had lost the recruitment had gone to court over it.

3
00:00:13,182 --> 00:00:26,390
“It was possible,” the minister said, “that we caused this.” Indeed, the offer carried a corresponding obligation, and nobody had read the last page.

4
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:31,924
They would go back to the case and move the reason onto the record.

5
00:00:31,924 --> 00:00:36,163
The removal of the seasonal officer was a surprise.

6
00:00:36,163 --> 00:00:50,754
A competitor with a presidency to protect, a counterpart in the other office, and a resident of the third storey all wanted a rating, and the rating obliged them to decorate the cafeteria before the visit.

7
00:00:50,754 --> 00:00:58,798
The workforce had been seasonal for eighteen years, and nobody had thought to tell the residents.

8
00:00:58,798 --> 00:01:06,791
The work was not really useful to them, and that was the question: for whose job was this a service?

9
00:01:06,791 --> 00:01:11,995
“A furnace and a gadget are both machines,” Maya said.

10
00:01:11,995 --> 00:01:26,278
“One heats a house, the other sells a house.” The wire, the lid, and the pig on the poster were the only decoration in the room, and the table was covered in outgoing mail.

11
00:01:26,278 --> 00:01:33,651
The outgoing chair had an urge to computerize everything and a wish to instal a new system by the winter.

12
00:01:33,651 --> 00:01:50,502
“We lean on the young workforce,” Lin wrote, “and then we call their fatigue a repayment.” A suspense of three weeks followed, and the congratulation that finally came was signed by someone who had never visited.

13
00:01:50,502 --> 00:02:02,330
The cause was, in the end, an orientation: the department was built for the orient and not for the town, and its recruitment followed the same map.

14
00:02:02,330 --> 00:02:10,188
“That is a proud way to fail,” the officer said, and everyone at the table knew that she was right.

15
00:02:10,188 --> 00:02:16,807
Their clothes, their dress, and their very habits in the corridor were part of the evidence.

16
00:02:16,807 --> 00:02:24,475
They had learned to operate the old system by habit, and the habit would haunt them for another year at least.

17
00:02:24,475 --> 00:02:30,948
Actually, the whole case had been in front of them for a month.
